OL,3,GNEWSAWhy do ex-MPs join the 'Chiltern
OL,4,AHundreds' list?
OL,5,
OL,6,FSir Keir Starmer and Boris Johnson have
OL,7,Fthis in common: They both stepped down
OL,8,Fas Prime Minister before their term was
OL,9,Fup, and within three years of winning
OL,10,Fan election.
OL,12,FTheir subsequent resignation as a
OL,13,Fsitting MP means they have also shared
OL,14,Fthe unusual office of "Steward and
OL,15,FBailiff of the Three Hundreds of
OL,16,FChiltern".
OL,18,FSir Keir is the latest person to pick
OL,19,Fup the title after resigning as an MP
OL,20,Fthis week.
